# Geometry translation provenance

Copyright (c) 2023, 2024, 2025, 2026 Obeo.
SPDX-License-Identifier: EPL-2.0

The source-derived geometry contracts retain the original Eclipse Public License
2.0 attribution. SysON's package and note source comments also acknowledge
inspiration from PapyrusSirius/papyrus-web. Repository root LICENSE and NOTICE
remain authoritative and unchanged. This new crate reuses the existing
`syson-editor` local crate; no registry dependency or relicensing is introduced.

Exact SysON/Sirius candidate revisions, source-file SHA256 values and selected
method excerpts are in `porting/follow-ons/F15/source-mapping.json`. Source pins
and local tests do not establish deployed artifact or browser correspondence.
